  <section class="student-included">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <h2 class="student-included-heading"><em>What's included</em></h2>
      <ul class="student-included-list">
        <li>Every essay and the full 20-year archive</li>
        <li>Audio versions of essays</li>
        <li>Mere&nbsp;Fidelity and Christians Reading Classics</li>
        <li>The Weekly Digest</li>
        <li>The private Discord community of readers</li>
        <li>Member dashboard, bookmarks, and the commonplace book</li>
        <li>The quarterly print journal <span class="student-included-tag">Print + Digital</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="migrate-faq">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <details class="migrate-faq-item">
        <summary class="migrate-faq-summary">
          <h2 class="migrate-faq-title"><em>Who qualifies?</em></h2>
          <span class="migrate-faq-chev" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </summary>
        <div class="migrate-faq-body">
          <p>Anyone with a valid school email address (e.g. .edu, .ac.uk, .edu.au, and other academic domains). We verify by emailing a confirmation link to that address before checkout. Each year, you confirm your school email again when you renew, which keeps you at the student rate.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="migrate-faq-item">
        <summary class="migrate-faq-summary">
          <h2 class="migrate-faq-title"><em>What's the difference between the two options?</em></h2>
          <span class="migrate-faq-chev" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </summary>
        <div class="migrate-faq-body">
          <p>Both give you full digital access to everything Mere&nbsp;Orthodoxy publishes. The $50 option adds the quarterly print journal, mailed to you. The $20 option is digital only.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="migrate-faq-item">
        <summary class="migrate-faq-summary">
          <h2 class="migrate-faq-title"><em>What happens when I graduate?</em></h2>
          <span class="migrate-faq-chev" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </summary>
        <div class="migrate-faq-body">
          <p>Your student membership is a one-time annual payment, so it simply ends unless you renew. We'll email you in the last month and show a reminder in your dashboard. When you're ready, you can move to a full membership any time.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script src="{{asset "js/student-checkout.js"}}"></script>

</main>
